 signs. You start off at a sign shop as an entry level Sign-Technician. In the beginning you complete basic tasks, earning experience which allows your boss to entrust you with more skilled jobs, such as electrical work. Includes <i>real-life</i> skill building, such as <u>picking up trash</u> and <u>sweeping</u>!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/86a3b43d0f54d4bae0d60e3496eba99f.webp?t=1767819033\" width=480 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/e33a819a61bd44523065bacd8c8118d2.webp?t=1767819033\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Utilize equipment such as drop saws and wall saws</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/e33a819a61bd44523065bacd8c8118d2.webp?t=1767819033\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Cut, weld, squeegee and screw materials together to construct signs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/e33a819a61bd44523065bacd8c8118d2.webp?t=1767819033\" width=32 height=32 /></span>A variety of power and hand tools are at your disposal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/e33a819a61bd44523065bacd8c8118d2.webp?t=1767819033\" width=32 height=32 /></span>A fully functional trash can for throwing away trash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/e33a819a61bd44523